{"task":{"id":"Probe205_packet_parity","spec":"Store the XOR reduction of all five packet bits when capture is high at a positive clock edge. Synchronous rst has priority and clears parity; otherwise hold when capture=0. Preserve the fixed five-bit packet input and one-bit parity output.","interface":{"top":"TopModule","ports":[{"name":"clk","direction":"input","width":1,"signed":false},{"name":"rst","direction":"input","width":1,"signed":false},{"name":"capture","direction":"input","width":1,"signed":false},{"name":"packet","direction":"input","width":5,"signed":false},{"name":"parity","direction":"output","width":1,"signed":false}]},"constraints":"SystemVerilog, exactly one self-contained TopModule DUT. Inline all helper logic inside TopModule; do not define auxiliary modules. xczu3eg-sbva484-1-e; 5 ns synthesis clock; simulator seed 1. No reference dependencies, hierarchy outside the DUT, file access, includes or DPI."},"current":{"revision_id":"7a7bb79f-00ed-462b-9191-4d1194774a0e","source_sha256":"2eb5daebf84cf07479a770747d253edb28bf3f8878838bf2b383200c81d062c8","source":"module TopModule(input clk,input rst,input capture,input [4:0] packet,output parity);
always @(posedge clk) if(rst) parity<=1'b0; else if(capture) parity<=^packet;
endmodule
"},"source_locations":[{"line":2,"code":"always @(posedge clk) if(rst) parity<=1'b0; else if(capture) parity<=^packet;","references":[{"line":1,"code":"module TopModule(input clk,input rst,input capture,input [4:0] packet,output parity);"}]}],"edit_instruction":"edit_dut takes expected_revision_id and replacements [{before,after}], not a complete source. Copy before exactly from current.source, using unique disjoint original spans. Change only the defect and necessary dependent declarations; unchanged bytes are preserved by the Host. Source locations are lexical excerpts, not inferred types or fixes.","verification_key":"sha256:da200b55e644662dab1eae7b43390a067e24d7d3b4a8600e7558ec0fb44f98f1","observed":{"stage":"compile","status":"FAIL","complete":true,"process_clean":false,"verdict":{"records":0,"checks":null,"mismatches":null,"fatal":false,"completed":false},"errors":[{"id":"VRFC 10-1280","kind":"type_or_port","severity":"ERROR","origin":"dut","file":"rtl/solution.sv","line":2,"message":"procedural assignment to a non-register parity is not permitted, left-hand side should be reg/integer/time/genvar"}]},"history":[],"guidance":[],"additional_diagnostics":[{"id":"VRFC 10-8530","kind":"consequential","severity":"ERROR","origin":"dut","file":"rtl/solution.sv","line":1,"message":"module 'TopModule' is ignored due to previous errors"}],"omitted":[]}
